*

# Explicit build-context allowlist.
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!web/
!web/**
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!cmd/**
!internal/
!internal/**
!protocol/
!protocol/**

# Private workspace and tool state must never reach the builder.
.git
.claude
**/.claude
.codegraph
**/.codegraph
.cursor
**/.cursor
.gemini
**/.gemini
.mcp.json
**/.mcp.json
.gohermit
**/.gohermit
sandbox
**/sandbox

# Dependency stores, caches, reports, and local build outputs.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store
**/.pnpm-store
.cache
**/.cache
.vite
**/.vite
coverage
**/coverage
playwright-report
**/playwright-report
test-results
**/test-results
dist
**/dist
hermit
hermit.exe
coverage.out
*.log
*.tmp
